    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is there is no \"how to use it.\" i used to think that once i got here, everything would finally make sense. but now that i'm actually here, the void is even bigger. it's like i spent a decade running toward a finish line that doesn't even exist. so what now? i don't see a path forward. it just feels like the story is over.",
