    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"rest and let the silence guide you\"... that sounds almost peaceful. because honestly, the struggle to find a \"new narrative\" sounds exhausting. i've given everything i have to the climb. i'm just so tired of trying to find a reason to keep going when the destination was empty. if there's no more mountain left to climb, what's the point in staying in the climb at all?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
